      "dialogText": "Edit inference\nwork\n2\n\nRequired fields are marked *\n\nNode id\n*\nLabel\n*\nSettings\n1 error\nContext\n1 set\nHarness\ncodex\nclaude\nOllama\n\nHarness that runs the session.\n\nModel\n(loop default) (gpt-6-luna)\nGPT-5.5 (gpt-5.5)\nGPT-5.6 Luna (gpt-5.6-luna)\nGPT-5.6 Sol (gpt-5.6-sol)\nGPT-5.6 Terra (gpt-5.6-terra)\nGPT-6 Astra (gpt-6-astra)\nGPT-6 Luna (gpt-6-luna)\nGPT-6 Sol (gpt-6-sol)\nGPT-6.1 Sol (gpt-6.1-sol)\nGPT-6.1 Terra (gpt-6.1-terra)\n\nDefault model: gpt-6-luna.\n\nCodex CLI was not found. Install the Codex CLI or set GG_CODEX_BINARY, then retry preflight.\n\nRetry Codex preflight\n\nModel; inherits within this harness from loop, owner, then process defaults.\n\nModel catalog in Settings\nEffort\nDefault (low)\nnone (no reasoning)\nlow\nmedium\nhigh\nxhigh\nmax\n\nDefault effort: low.\n\nReasoning effort; inherits within this harness like the model. Catalog effort is guidance only.\n\nSandbox\nread-only\nworkspace-write\ndanger-full-access\n\nSandbox or tool policy. Claude requires an explicit supported policy and provides no OS/read-path confinement.\n\nAdvanced\n2 set\n1 error\nHARNESS OPTIONS\nApproval\nnever\non-request\n\nWhether the harness may stop to ask before acting.\n\nNetwork access\nNot set\nYes\nNo\n\nLet commands in the sandbox reach the network.\n\nWeb search\nNot set\nYes\nNo\n\nLet the model search the web.\n\nEdit as JSON\nConfig overrides\n\nRaw Codex configuration. Each dotted key segment must use letters, digits, _ or -, and not __proto__, constructor or prototype.\n\nKey\nValue\n*\nJSON\n1\n{\"marker\":\"reserved-changed\",\"__proto__\":false,\"survivor\":true}\n\n__proto__: Codex config overrides require every key segment to use letters, digits, \"_\" or \"-\", and not __proto__, constructor or prototype.\nDiscard the unparsed text\n\nKey\nValue\n*\nJSON\n1\n\"unchanged\"\nAdd entry\nEdit as JSON\n\nNo resolved capability identifiers are available. Enter authored slugs.\n\nAdd capabilities\nOUTPUT\nCapture\nNot set\nauto\ntext\n\nOmitted or auto uses existing JSON-or-text capture; text captures final text verbatim.\n\nCapture transcript\nartifact\nnone\n\nKeep the session transcript as an artifact, or not.\n\nTo messages\nfinal\nfinal-and-notes\nnone\n\nWhat the answer adds to the thread's messages.\n\nEdit as JSON\nTransforms\n\nMutations applied to the answer before it lands.\n\nAdd transforms\nAdd schema\nLIMITS\nTimeout seconds\n\nOptional watchdog; a timeout fails the run.\n\nDelete node\nDone",
